      "currency": "USD",
      "description": "Available for Pre-Order! Contact your AMACO distributor to place your pre-order for the Pearlescent Glaze Series. Get your order in early to be among the first to receive these new glazes when they become available. P-65 Sienna Frost is a fluid, orange-tan with iridescent mottling where thick. Food Safe: Tested for lead and cadmium release in accordance with ASTM C738-94. Application Tips: 3 brush coats recommended. If you apply the glaze heavily, 2 coats will also work. Best glazing brush to use: AMACO Fitch Fan Brush. Underapplication will result in a dry glaze with no crystals. Overapplication will cause a rough appearance. Can also lead to heavier flow. Layers well over AMACO Celadons , other Potter's Choice, and Satin Matte glazes. Glaze layering fired results may run if paired with a runny glaze. Apply receding coats when layering to help with runniness of final fired result. We recommend testing any layering combination before applying it to a full ceramic piece. Fire to cone 6 when used alone or layered for results similar to AMACO imagery. Shake well before use. For best results, do not thin the glaze; apply 3 coats with a brush to Cone 04 bisque. (Let the glaze dry between coats.) Glaze fire to Cone 5-6. Due to variations in raw materials used during manufacturing, we recommend firing glazed test tiles before using each new batch of glaze.",
